{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3622610/extras/beef903b9b83f9b1d09949c902f36a1a.avif?t=1752477054\" data-has-big width=800 height=105 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The tone-deaf Dark Lord &quot;Discord&quot; has stolen the Melody!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With music gone, the kingdom of Meloria has fallen into silence \u2014 and now, your voice is <strong>the only hope.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3622610/extras/81fdd3f13ac537c0dfeff06334a62a24.avif?t=1752477054\" data-has-big width=800 height=102 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >This is a <strong>voice-controlled puzzle adventure game.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sing, shout, whisper</strong> \u2014 your voice change the world!</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Puzzles react to the <strong>Pitch, Volume, and Rhythm of your voice</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Use your voice</strong> to battle monsters and break through obstacles standing in your way.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face off against <strong>music-themed bosses</strong> and defeat them using a variety of <strong>voice-based skills!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3622610/extras/2d9c3e1e3244385ec32b76980601a7a9.avif?t=1752477054\" data-has-big width=800 height=103 /></span>Become the hero of Meloria with <strong>the power of your voice!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You don\u2019t have to be a great singer \u2014 here, In this world, a heartfelt voice is the strongest weapon of all.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >---------------------------------------------------</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>This game is currently in demo version.<br>At this time, only Chapter 1 is available, and certain areas may not run as smoothly as intended.<br>We\u2019re actively working to improve the experience, and we truly appreciate your patience and understanding.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Your feedback is always welcome.<br>Thank you so much for playing! :)</i></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3622610?t=1752477054","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3622610/6b6bc0c9c80c5e8cbdc1f324bceb79ab122aa0ef/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1752477054","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3622610/88f46d4ee7e9cbd979eb818670b1796b0bfbb47a/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1752477054","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3622610/88f46d4ee7e9cbd979eb818670b1796b0bfbb47a/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1752477054","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3779940,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3622610/extras/beef903b9b83f9b1d09949c902f36a1a.avif?t=1752477054\" data-has-big width=800 height=105 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The tone-deaf Dark Lord &quot;Discord&quot; has stolen the Melody!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With music gone, the kingdom of Meloria has fallen into silence \u2014 and now, your voice is <strong>the only hope.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3622610/extras/81fdd3f13ac537c0dfeff06334a62a24.avif?t=1752477054\" data-has-big width=800 height=102 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >This is a <strong>voice-controlled puzzle adventure game.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sing, shout, whisper</strong> \u2014 your voice change the world!</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Puzzles react to the <strong>Pitch, Volume, and Rhythm of your voice</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Use your voice</strong> to battle monsters and break through obstacles standing in your way.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face off against <strong>music-themed bosses</strong> and defeat them using a variety of <strong>voice-based skills!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3622610/extras/2d9c3e1e3244385ec32b76980601a7a9.avif?t=1752477054\" data-has-big width=800 height=103 /></span>Become the hero of Meloria with <strong>the power of your voice!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You don\u2019t have to be a great singer \u2014 here, In this world, a heartfelt voice is the strongest weapon of all.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >---------------------------------------------------</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>This game is currently in demo version.<br>At this time, only Chapter 1 is available, and certain areas may not run as smoothly as intended.<br>We\u2019re actively working to improve the experience, and we truly appreciate your patience and understanding.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Your feedback is always welcome.<br>Thank you so much for playing! :)</i></p>","developers":["PPPG"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/